    <string name="gamepad_guide_title">Before using the gamepad</string>
    <string name="gamepad_guide_modes">Choose Native for Windows/Linux games, Android for games on Android, or Web when a browser game ignores directions. Tap the controller mode button to switch; hold it to open settings.</string>
    <string name="gamepad_guide_xinput">On Windows, some newer games accept only Xbox XInput controllers. Bluke is a standard Bluetooth HID gamepad, so Steam Input or another compatibility layer may be needed.</string>
    <string name="gamepad_guide_cache">If the host cached an older Bluke controller layout, forget Bluke on both devices and pair again once.</string>
